  "cuts": [
    {
      "id": "scene_0",
      "text": "I spent three months to understand the YouTube shorts algorithm, and here it is in 120 seconds.",
      "in_seconds": 0.0,
      "out_seconds": 5.52,
      "source": "projects/youtube_algo_project_10/images/[00-00]_Hand-drawn_2D_doo.jpg",
      "animation": "ken-burns",
      "sfx": {
        "src": "projects/common_assets/sfx/whoosh.mp3",
        "volume": 0.5,
        "startOffsetSeconds": 0.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scene_1",
      "text": "The shorts feed algorithm uses a single metric as the ultimate gatekeeper for your reach.",
      "in_seconds": 5.52,
      "out_seconds": 10.2,
      "source": "projects/youtube_algo_project_10/images/[00-05]_Hand-drawn_2D_doo.jpg",
      "animation": "ken-burns",
      "sfx": {
        "src": "projects/common_assets/sfx/pop.mp3",
        "volume": 0.5,
        "startOffsetSeconds": 0.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scene_2",
      "text": "This is the viewed versus swiped away rate.",
      "in_seconds": 10.2,
      "out_seconds": 12.54,
      "source": "projects/youtube_algo_project_10/images/[00-10]_Hand-drawn_2D_doo.jpg",
      "animation": "none",
      "sfx": {
        "src": "projects/common_assets/sfx/ping.mp3",
        "volume": 0.5,
        "startOffsetSeconds": 0.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scene_3",
      "text": "It tracks the exact percentage of viewers who stop to watch your short versus those who",
      "in_seconds": 12.54,
      "out_seconds": 16.7,
      "source": "projects/youtube_algo_project_10/images/[00-12]_Hand-drawn_2D_doo.jpg",
      "animation": "ken-burns",
      "sfx": {
        "src": "projects/common_assets/sfx/click.mp3",
        "volume": 0.5,
        "startOffsetSeconds": 0.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scene_4",
      "text": "swipe past it.",
      "in_seconds": 16.7,
      "out_seconds": 18.02,
      "source": "projects/youtube_algo_project_10/images/[00-12]_Hand-drawn_2D_doo.jpg",
      "animation": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene_5",
      "text": "To go viral today, you need at least 70-90% of those viewers to stay.",
      "in_seconds": 18.02,
      "out_seconds": 22.44,
      "source": "projects/youtube_algo_project_10/images/[00-18]_Hand-drawn_2D_doo.jpg",
      "animation": "ken-burns",
      "sfx": {
        "src": "projects/common_assets/sfx/chime.mp3",
        "volume": 0.5,
        "startOffsetSeconds": 0.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scene_6",
      "text": "How do you pass this initial gate?",
      "in_seconds": 22.44,
      "out_seconds": 24.38,
      "source": "projects/youtube_algo_project_10/images/[00-22]_Hand-drawn_2D_doo.jpg",
      "animation": "none",
      "sfx": {
        "src": "projects/common_assets/sfx/riser.mp3",
        "volume": 0.5,
        "startOffsetSeconds": 0.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scene_7",
      "text": "You must optimize the first two seconds of your video to capture attention immediately.",
      "in_seconds": 24.38,
      "out_seconds": 28.54,
      "source": "projects/youtube_algo_project_10/images/[00-24]_Hand-drawn_2D_doo.jpg",
      "animation": "ken-burns",
      "sfx": {
        "src": "projects/common_assets/sfx/clock-ticking.mp3",
        "volume": 0.5,
        "startOffsetSeconds": 0.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scene_8",
      "text": "This is the hook gate.",
      "in_seconds": 28.54,
      "out_seconds": 30.18,
      "source": "projects/youtube_algo_project_10/images/[00-28]_Hand-drawn_2D_doo.jpg",
      "animation": "none",
      "sfx": {
        "src": "projects/common_assets/sfx/whoosh.mp3",
        "volume": 0.5,
        "startOffsetSeconds": 0.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scene_9",
      "text": "If more than 40% of viewers swipe away in those first moments,",
      "in_seconds": 30.18,
      "out_seconds": 33.88,
      "source": "projects/youtube_algo_project_10/images/[00-30]_Hand-drawn_2D_doo.jpg",
      "animation": "none",
      "sfx": {
        "src": "projects/common_assets/sfx/error.mp3",
        "volume": 0.5,
        "startOffsetSeconds": 0.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scene_10",
      "text": "YouTube stops distributing your video.",
      "in_seconds": 33.88,
      "out_seconds": 36.06,
      "source": "projects/youtube_algo_project_10/images/[00-30]_Hand-drawn_2D_doo.jpg",
      "animation": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene_11",
      "text": "A recent major platform up he changed how views are calculated.",
      "in_seconds": 36.06,
      "out_seconds": 39.84,
      "source": "projects/youtube_algo_project_10/images/[00-36]_Hand-drawn_2D_doo.jpg",
      "animation": "none",
      "sfx": {
        "src": "projects/common_assets/sfx/key-press.mp3",
        "volume": 0.5,
        "startOffsetSeconds": 0.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scene_12",
      "text": "A view is now counted the moment your video starts to play.",
      "in_seconds": 39.84,
      "out_seconds": 42.98,
      "source": "projects/youtube_algo_project_10/images/[00-39]_Hand-drawn_2D_doo.jpg",
      "animation": "none",
      "sfx": {
        "src": "projects/common_assets/sfx/notification.mp3",
        "volume": 0.5,
        "startOffsetSeconds": 0.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scene_13",
      "text": "Why is this update dangerous?",
      "in_seconds": 42.98,
      "out_seconds": 44.92,
      "source": "projects/youtube_algo_project_10/images/[00-42]_Hand-drawn_2D_doo.jpg",
      "animation": "none",
      "sfx": {
        "src": "projects/common_assets/sfx/riser.mp3",
        "volume": 0.5,
        "startOffsetSeconds": 0.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scene_14",
      "text": "Raw views have become a vanity metric because of instant scroll buys.",
      "in_seconds": 44.92,
      "out_seconds": 48.74,
      "source": "projects/youtube_algo_project_10/images/[00-44]_Hand-drawn_2D_doo.jpg",
      "animation": "none",
      "sfx": {
        "src": "projects/common_assets/sfx/anime-wow.mp3",
        "volume": 0.5,
        "startOffsetSeconds": 0.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scene_15",
      "text": "The algorithm now relies heavily on average percentage viewed or av.",
      "in_seconds": 48.74,
      "out_seconds": 52.56,
      "source": "projects/youtube_algo_project_10/images/[00-48]_Hand-drawn_2D_doo.jpg",
      "animation": "none",
      "sfx": {
        "src": "projects/common_assets/sfx/pop.mp3",
        "volume": 0.5,
        "startOffsetSeconds": 0.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scene_16",
      "text": "It favors videos with APV over 100%, which means people are looping your video.",
      "in_seconds": 52.56,
      "out_seconds": 58.42,
      "source": "projects/youtube_algo_project_10/images/[00-52]_Hand-drawn_2D_doo.jpg",
      "animation": "ken-burns",
      "sfx": {
        "src": "projects/common_assets/sfx/chime.mp3",
        "volume": 0.5,
        "startOffsetSeconds": 0.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scene_17",
      "text": "Rewatch behavior is the strongest signal of high quality.",
      "in_seconds": 58.42,
      "out_seconds": 61.72,
      "source": "projects/youtube_algo_project_10/images/[00-58]_Hand-drawn_2D_doo.jpg",
      "animation": "none",
      "sfx": {
        "src": "projects/common_assets/sfx/ping.mp3",
        "volume": 0.5,
        "startOffsetSeconds": 0.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scene_18",
      "text": "How do you induce a loop?",
      "in_seconds": 61.72,
      "out_seconds": 63.14,
      "source": "projects/youtube_algo_project_10/images/[01-01]_Hand-drawn_2D_doo.jpg",
      "animation": "none",
      "sfx": {
        "src": "projects/common_assets/sfx/pop.mp3",
        "volume": 0.5,
        "startOffsetSeconds": 0.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scene_19",
      "text": "You must design a seamless transition from the end of the video back to the start.",
      "in_seconds": 63.14,
      "out_seconds": 66.9,
      "source": "projects/youtube_algo_project_10/images/[01-03]_Hand-drawn_2D_doo.jpg",
      "animation": "none",
      "sfx": {
        "src": "projects/common_assets/sfx/whoosh.mp3",
        "volume": 0.5,
        "startOffsetSeconds": 0.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scene_20",
      "text": "The system also tracks engaged views, which measures viewers who stay for a significant duration.",
      "in_seconds": 66.9,
      "out_seconds": 72.12,
      "source": "projects/youtube_algo_project_10/images/[01-06]_Hand-drawn_2D_doo.jpg",
      "animation": "ken-burns",
      "sfx": {
        "src": "projects/common_assets/sfx/click.mp3",
        "volume": 0.5,
        "startOffsetSeconds": 0.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scene_21",
      "text": "This metric decides your partner program revenue and long-term reach.",
      "in_seconds": 72.12,
      "out_seconds": 75.76,
      "source": "projects/youtube_algo_project_10/images/[01-12]_Hand-drawn_2D_doo.jpg",
      "animation": "none",
      "sfx": {
        "src": "projects/common_assets/sfx/chime.mp3",
        "volume": 0.5,
        "startOffsetSeconds": 0.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scene_22",
      "text": "To grow your channel, focus entirely on holding attention past the three second mark.",
      "in_seconds": 75.76,
      "out_seconds": 79.959,
      "source": "projects/youtube_algo_project_10/images/[01-15]_Hand-drawn_2D_doo.jpg",
      "animation": "ken-burns",
      "sfx": {
        "src": "projects/common_assets/sfx/ping.mp3",
        "volume": 0.5,
        "startOffsetSeconds": 0.0
      }
    }
  ],
